{
  "kind": "floret.patch",
  "version": 2,
  "appVersion": "0.0.1",
  "meta": {
    "name": "Plexus Colours",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z",
    "modifiedAt": "2026-10-09T00:00:00.000Z"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "pc_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -294
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Plexus colours\n\nA flock (Simulation) wanders the canvas. An Expression gives each bird a colour from its position, and Connect Points, with `colors` wired and `colorBy` `points`, draws every line as a gradient from one end's colour to the other's.\n\nSet `colorBy` to `length` to run the colours from the shortest lines (first colour) to the longest instead.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 230
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Plexus colours\n\nA flock (Simulation) wanders the canvas. An Expression gives each bird a colour from its position, and Connect Points, with `colors` wired and `colorBy` `points`, draws every line as a gradient from one end's colour to the other's.\n\nSet `colorBy` to `length` to run the colours from the shortest lines (first colour) to the longest instead.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 230
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pc_sim",
      "defType": "particles/simulation",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 23
      },
      "params": {
        "mode": "flocking"
      },
      "portValues": {
        "count": 170,
        "size": {
          "x": 700,
          "y": 460
        },
        "maxSpeed": 75,
        "scale": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pc_hue",
      "defType": "math/expression",
      "position": {
        "x": 269,
        "y": 73
      },
      "params": {
        "expr": "hsl(0.52 + 0.4 * (p.x / 700 + 0.5), 0.85, 0.6)"
      },
      "portValues": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "pc_st",
      "defType": "style/stroke",
      "position": {
